{
  "why": [
    "What one Raspberry Pi 4 with a Global Shutter Camera actually answered, recorded",
    "off the board on 2026-09-04 and pinned here.",
    "",
    "It exists because R-UI-03 builds navigation from detected hardware and R-UI-12",
    "photographs every page on every build. With no camera attached there is no camera",
    "page, so the capture gate covers none of the camera work and does not complain —",
    "from its point of view there is nothing there. This is the camera CI does not have.",
    "",
    "`found` and `rejected` are verbatim the shape `detectCameras()` returns, so a change",
    "to that shape shows up here as a diff rather than as a page that renders nothing.",
    "The other keys are what the harness has to seed alongside it: the configured camera",
    "the pages are about, the encoder `probeEncoder()` found, and a deliberately fake",
    "RTSP credential.",
    "",
    "**The credential is fake on purpose.** The stream-address surface shows a *resolved*",
    "RTSP password (R-VID-15) and R-UI-12 commits the captured images, so a capture taken",
    "against a real device would put a real secret in this repository for ever.",
    "capture-pages.mjs reads the device's own secrets.yaml and fails any page whose HTML",
    "carries that value — this fake is what the pages render instead (R-SEC-10).",
    "",
    "**`recording` and `stills` are seeded here, and every other capability is the board's own",
    "answer.** Neither is a V4L2 control, so `v4l2-ctl` says nothing about either and",
    "`probeCamera` has no reader for them: the `not-offered` they would otherwise carry is",
    "`noCapabilities()`'s default — the *model's* answer, not the board's. Where a recording or",
    "a still can go is the daemon's fact (spec 8.3, R-CAM-17, R-CAM-18, R-STO-06), and the",
    "daemon in this harness is this file. They are `advertised` with the reason, which is what",
    "is actually true today: the console can command a capture and the board has nowhere to put",
    "the file, because board recording is not built. The camera page therefore draws the Record",
    "and Photo keys where they belong — under the picture, R-UI-26 — inoperative, in the caution",
    "tone, carrying that sentence (spec section 4). Change these to `present` only when there is",
    "somewhere for a file to land.",
    "",
    "`found[0].capabilities` is rebuilt from the committed v4l2-ctl capture named in",
    "`recorded.capabilitiesRebuiltFrom`, by the same CONTROL_MAP loop probeCamera uses.",
    "Regenerate it that way rather than editing states by hand: when the capability model",
    "gains a key, a hand-edited fixture is a guess and a rebuilt one is the board's answer."
  ],
